Where things run

The `Web app` calls the `API`, and the `API` reads the `Database`. Each runs in
a region: the `Web app` in `global`, the `API` and the `Database` in
`eu-west-1`. Use the key `region`.
---
Web app -> API
API -> Database: read
Web app { region: global }
API, Database { region: eu-west-1 }
